{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Sleep Terror",
    "steam_appid": 2879710,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > &quot;SLEEP TERROR&quot;  is an adventure-exploration horror game in which you travel through your nightmares and dreams. Travel through various places, explore and use the tools and items found on the board to make your escape easier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879710/extras/e5ba220f17d7ca84c841ad4324d28713.poster.avif?t=1755116940\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879710/extras/e5ba220f17d7ca84c841ad4324d28713.webm?t=1755116940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879710/extras/e5ba220f17d7ca84c841ad4324d28713.mp4?t=1755116940\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game you can have fun, be scared and enjoy the atmosphere while looking for the exit on different maps. Look for ways to escape from the creatures and find a way out. Try to survive and just have fun. The game features various boards, from the well-known backrooms and poolrooms, but also something completely different, such as forest and wendigo gardens and much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879710/extras/19d0fe3758ad31896ce4fd13055d1541.poster.avif?t=1755116940\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879710/extras/19d0fe3758ad31896ce4fd13055d1541.webm?t=1755116940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879710/extras/19d0fe3758ad31896ce4fd13055d1541.mp4?t=1755116940\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many terrible maps you must overcome to get out of here. Explore and use the items included in the level to make your escape easier!\u00a0Keep your eyes peeled - Some maps contain creatures that have no friendly intentions towards you. There are also levels that involve chilling through the board (Poolrooms) with great, calm music in the background!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different levels offer different items that help you pass the level. Use flashlights, lamps, glow sticks, maps and other useful things to make your escape easier. Items are assigned to specific levels and their number of uses is infinite at this point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879710/extras/fb2a44d3ff6e2d21ceb80a3023208e18.webp?t=1755116940\" width=616 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879710/extras/8ddf86d77232172187667fe18ed9a9c4.poster.avif?t=1755116940\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879710/extras/8ddf86d77232172187667fe18ed9a9c4.webm?t=1755116940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879710/extras/8ddf86d77232172187667fe18ed9a9c4.mp4?t=1755116940\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the game you will encounter various creatures that have different mechanics. Most of them will have hostile intentions towards you.\u00a0Monsters have 3D jumpscare animations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879710/extras/ac2c184526c1238776427708ccfac755.webp?t=1755116940\" width=616 height=45 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879710/extras/8fa18339ecb347cd06df4edf3f0da60c.poster.avif?t=1755116940\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879710/extras/8fa18339ecb347cd06df4edf3f0da60c.webm?t=1755116940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879710/extras/8fa18339ecb347cd06df4edf3f0da60c.mp4?t=1755116940\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the game you can enable the VHS BODYCAM overlay known from other horror movies. It can be turned on/off with one click without leaving the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOTE: The game is made by one person, if you want to support my game add it to your wishlist, thank you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
