 ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879710/extras/ac2c184526c1238776427708ccfac755.webp?t=1755116940\" width=616 height=45 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879710/extras/8fa18339ecb347cd06df4edf3f0da60c.poster.avif?t=1755116940\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879710/extras/8fa18339ecb347cd06df4edf3f0da60c.webm?t=1755116940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879710/extras/8fa18339ecb347cd06df4edf3f0da60c.mp4?t=1755116940\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the game you can enable the VHS BODYCAM overlay known from other horror movies. It can be turned on/off with one click without leaving the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOTE: The game is made by one person, if you want to support my game add it to your wishlist, thank you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
